  "reason": "The sole current working-model lane is the pinned CPU trainer. These historical sequence/top-k producers and old adapter-source exporter are superseded; the exporter targets a removed tinyrustlm-slm-pack/ALR1 contract. No current code importer exists outside this reviewed group.",
