    "Keep verified current checkpoint payloads once; preserve metrics and receipt history.",
    "Test effective gradient-accumulation normalization and retain separate supervised/KL metrics; low optimizer loss is not a behavior result.",
    "Token-level teacher distributions require exact tokenizer and rendered-token identities, assistant-position masks, deterministic ties and complete normalized tail mass.",
    "Validate serialized factor dtype, shape, range, finite values and complete coverage in the actual consumer; do not revive an obsolete runtime format.",
    "Separate terminally rejected source ancestry from product eligibility; a prior recipe or successful structural test is not fresh training authority."
  ],
